---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Product collects, uses, and protects your information."
>
  <article class="legal">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: August 27, 2026</p>

    <p>
      This privacy policy describes how Product (“we”, “us”) handles information when you visit our
      website or join our waitlist. This is a placeholder policy for early access and will be updated
      before launch.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>
      If you join the waitlist, we collect the email address you provide. We may also collect basic
      technical data such as browser type and approximate location from server logs.
    </p>

    <h2>How we use information</h2>
    <p>
      We use waitlist emails to notify you about product updates, launch availability, and related
      communications. We do not sell your personal information.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy can be sent to
      <a href="mailto:privacy@product.example">privacy@product.example</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .updated {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-sm);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
</style>
